       瑰夏-or-瑰夏like\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          做了浅焙和中深焙两款\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7R3DDsSvYdFXBPEgm7X4OawibyEIEUWib3TFSgANyZRa57LaS8bBWdMwDKgiciajr8uiacYzxeYQclia71w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           Garden Heights 2020 Light\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          PNG Lamari Arusha/Bourbon Washed 30%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          PNG Baroida Arusha/Bourbon Anaerobic Natural 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          China Puwen Flying Dragon Catimor P3/P4 Super-Duper Natural 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Bonbe 74158 Anaerobic Natural 10%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Ethiopia Gelena Gesha Natural 10%\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Colombia El Paraiso Castillo Washed 10%\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Colombia El Placer Spice-up Caturra Washed 10%\n         </sp